"1njfql0mh0v": "Feb 6, 1923 · Clerk Feucht · pencil",
"11mzv8aaxwh": "Drawn looking into the kitchen from the front door. The clerk noted that he drew it “as seen, nothing moved.”",
"ny663wg0xf": "Stove firebox and ash drawer",
"286ez939j2z": "Ash has overflowed the ash drawer onto the floor. Fine white ash on top; beneath it, many alternating layers of black charcoal and white ash. The woodbox beside it is empty down to the boards.",
"18xrot4c6e6": "Folded newspaper on the table",
"1kdw1crfl6i": "The Wochenblatt, folded in four. The clerk has noted “No. 8, Jan 27.” beside it. No sign that it was opened.",
"1zt1vd5ol4b": "Attic door at the top of the stairs",
"1d6l8z2v5py": "A plank door at the top of the stairs. The bolt is on the inside, the attic side. Only someone up in the attic can bolt it, and it cannot be opened from the kitchen.",
"6ww11y26m3": "Dog bowl in the doorway",
"1qqj63n0ozm": "A wooden bowl on the floor in the doorway. Bread crusts and scraps of boiled potato dried on in two layers. The dog was alive, chained to a post in the yard.",
