"1oj8q8vldva": "Cow trough",
"4zp6ie8t7y": "Only scraps in the bottom of the trough, yet spilled hay lies heaped knee-high on its rim and across the aisle in front. Several times the amount for a single feeding.",
"1rhwjy3w9nh": "Overturned milk pail and milking stool",
"1ovpue52xya": "An overturned milk pail in front of the pigsty. The milking stool is set facing the pigsty, not the cows. A whitish residue dried onto the bottom of the pig trough.",
"2975yuivy6": "Post in the barn's west bay",
"2crh2kwqwi8": "A few white horsehairs caught on a nail in the post. On the ground, a heap of horse dung and spilled oats. This household keeps no horses.",
