"2dqtm4o0f1r": "In the snow that fell overnight, a single line of footprints coming to the house from the forest. None going back out.",
"1au0ovgjmkt": "A peddler calls and sells needles and thread. He saw only the old couple and the daughter, and says the dog barked furiously.",
"1dj5zab8e5v": "Rosa pulls the milk cart to the collection point. 15 liters.",
"16kvbk4mhl0": "A hired cab sets the new maid and her suitcase down at the gate. Rosa comes out and takes the bags.",
"26kfnodwxhz": "The milk cart does not come. Nor does anyone come for the new lock ordered at the smithy.",
"8mhhjyjm41": "Not one of the family is seen at Mass. Yet from across the fields, smoke can be seen rising from the chimney.",
"2cuoy06efr": "Saturday's paper, left in the mailbox, is gone. Smoke from the chimney. At the head of the forest path, a white-horse sledge, the horse under a blanket.",
"1ub3xqzrg2m": "At the inn on the Kelbach market square, a market guest signs the register in his own hand. Horse and sledge go in the rear stable.",
"odqbzmtcmr": "All night the cows' bellowing carries across the fields to the neighbors.",
"265z803cpbo": "All nine cards are in their slots. From the morning of January 24 to the night of February 3.",
